---
title: "cancel (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin invokes cancel()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_locked: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_locked: cancelLocked == true
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert CancellationLocked
    q_check_locked --> q_cancel: cancelLocked == false
    q_cancel --> [*]: cancelled = true; emit SaleCancelled()

    note right of q_check_locked
        INV-001: Cancellation blocked once initializePublishSaleResults has been called
        INV-002: cancelLocked prevents race condition between cancel and result publication
    end note
